# INFRA-CLOSEOUT-MS0/U-HISTORY-STRIP (2026-05-12) — exclusions retroactively
# applied after the GitHub push-reject on oversized blobs in branch history.
# These paths were stripped from history via git-filter-repo; the rules below
# prevent them from being re-introduced.
#
# Whisper/ML model weights — never check in, download via Ollama / HF on demand.
models/
*.bin
